    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're Here, Papa</i> is a VR horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark depths of the sewer, you must find your way and escape on your own. But you are not alone down there. Something is pursuing you. You don\u2019t know what it is, but one thing is certain\u2026 you must not let it catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late at night in 2015, Las Vegas. After a long day, you were on your way back to the hotel when you suddenly blacked out. When you woke up, you found yourself in a dark, damp sewer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get back home, you must navigate this maze alone. But in this desolate place, the echo of footsteps tells you someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is following. You must hurry and escape this darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We're Here, PAPA&quot; Game Guide</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out of the sewer and contact the rescue team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your phone to light up the dark paths and clear the obstacles blocking your way to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014never let the thing chasing you catch up. If it does, you might never make it out of there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graphics and realistic sound effects will draw you into the experience.<br>Try it now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're Here, Papa</i> is a VR horror game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark depths of the sewer, you must find your way and escape on your own. But you are not alone down there. Something is pursuing you. You don\u2019t know what it is, but one thing is certain\u2026 you must not let it catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late at night in 2015, Las Vegas. After a long day, you were on your way back to the hotel when you suddenly blacked out. When you woke up, you found yourself in a dark, damp sewer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get back home, you must navigate this maze alone. But in this desolate place, the echo of footsteps tells you someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is following. You must hurry and escape this darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We're Here, PAPA&quot; Game Guide</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out of the sewer and contact the rescue team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your phone to light up the dark paths and clear the obstacles blocking your way to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014never let the thing chasing you catch up. If it does, you might never make it out of there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graphics and realistic sound effects will draw you into the experience.<br>Try it now!</p>",
